        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 因积分不易求出，所以用积分中值定理去掉积分符号再求极限."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "由积分中值定理得"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "\\begin{array}{r l}\\lim _ {x \\rightarrow + \\infty} \\sqrt {x} \\int_ {x} ^ {x + 1} \\frac {\\mathrm{d} t}{\\sqrt {t + \\sin t + x}}&= \\lim _ {x \\rightarrow + \\infty} \\frac {\\sqrt {x}}{\\sqrt {(x + \\theta) + \\sin (x + \\theta) + x}} (0 <   \\theta <   1)\\\\&= \\lim _ {x \\rightarrow + \\infty} \\frac {1}{\\sqrt {2 + \\frac {\\theta + \\sin (x + \\theta)}{x}}} = \\frac {1}{\\sqrt {2}}.\\end{array}"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "用积分中值定理去掉积分符号再求极限.",
